Fri Oct  2 14:55:25 UTC 2026 - Dominique Leuenberger <dimstar@opensuse.org>

- Update to version 2.54.1:
  + What's new in WebKitGTK 2.54.1?:
    - Allow pasting in-memory image data from clipboard.
    - Add User-Agent quirk for Amazon Luna.
    - Align the filter surface with the device pixel grid.
    - Fix rendering of scaled or transformed no-repeat background
      images.
    - Fix rendering of preserve-3d layers when a layer crosses the
      camera plane.
    - Fix SkiaCompositingLayer filter rendering under transforms.
    - Do not rasterize the part of a tile that the clip drops.
    - Skip non-composited frames when damage is empty.
    - Fix text deleted by input method delete-surrounding in
      contenteditable.
    - Fix several crashes and rendering issues.
- Drop 5d013e57c4c4e2674e28399fc162afa3adf25283.patch and
  webkitgtk-main-thread.patch: fixed upstream.

